note for users "Logical authority: existing Profile accounts; no collection rename or auth migration."
note for career_goals "One current goal/chat per account; validated saves automatically move the current pointer. Goal revisions are immutable; versioned exploration drafts and requirement_review records share this collection. Review content/baseline are structured values only; immutable goals reference the exact source review version. Draft role/field may be unknown; confirmed role/field are required. Drafts retain adaptive topic context, current focus/question, total_turns and latest 30 turns. Structured progress and bounded evidence only; no raw JD/CV text."

note for interview_research "Immutable public-context revisions; shared seven-day reuse. Private career_state links constrain user reads. Operational research_contexts holds leases/cache pointers. Brave API adapters acquire evidence. Operational LangGraph checkpoints expire after 24h inactivity; current goals persist. Unavailable acquisition preserves saved goals/research."

